      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "風の強い午後、外遊びが中止になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "迷子案内所の子ども向けに、紙芝居を作ることになった。作・ミミ、画・ピオニー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "題名は「かみのかんむりと、やさしいかいじゅう」実話をもとにした、フィクションだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ピオニーの絵は、意外なほど繊細だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "特大クレヨンの怪獣は、どれも困り顔で、どこか本人に似ている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「かいじゅうは、こわい顔が、にがてなの」——作者の実感。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "問題は、リハーサルで起きた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "怪獣の登場シーンで、ピオニーが張り切って足踏みをした。ずしん。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "shake"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "館内放送は「地震ではありません。繰り返します」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "効果音というより、耳の奥まで、リアルすぎた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……こうかおん、きんし?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "禁止じゃないです。工夫です。……そうだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "逆にしましょう。あなたの怪獣は「世界一静かな怪獣」です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "台本を書き直した。怪獣は、足音を立てない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街のみんなを起こさないよう、爪先立ちで歩く。くしゃみを我慢して、雲の陰に隠れる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ピオニーは台本を三回読んで、小さく言った。「この怪獣、しってる」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "本番は、風の強い午後の案内所。満員（子ども八人）。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ピオニーの怪獣役は、迫真だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "爪先立ちの震え、くしゃみの我慢、紙の冠を直す指先。全部、演技じゃないから強い。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "物語の最後、静かな怪獣は、街の子に紙の冠をもらう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その行を読んだ時、観客の女の子が立ち上がった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "本物のピオニーの角に、自分の紙冠を掛けに行く。台本にない、最高の結末だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1e9iq7o",
      "speakerName": "ピオニー",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……ミミ。かいじゅうは、しずかじゃなくても、よかったのかな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "はい。今日の拍手、聞きました?　あれ、半分はあなたの足踏み待ちでしたよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "次回作は「うるさい怪獣」でいきましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "peony.bond.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "peony.bond.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終演後の片付けで、残りの午後の使い方を決める。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
